    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This is a fairy tale for adults.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Anxiety Puppy</i> is an interactive visual novel that tells the story of a young girl in a bustling city, who, while struggling with the pressures of life and work, unexpectedly embarks on a spiritual journey toward reconciling with her anxiety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her life trajectory seems no different from anyone else\u2019s\u2014studying, finding a job, working, with days that repeat endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, only she knows that beneath every seemingly calm day, anxiety grows like an uncontrollable black line, suffocating her breath and tightening her nerves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On one of her usual sleepless nights, her anxiety spirals out of control again, and she is pulled into a strange world. What is it? She doesn\u2019t know, but maybe she can talk to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fresh Hand-drawn Style</strong> \u2013 A beautiful, healing, original illustrated storybook art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Game Theme</strong> \u2013 The game focuses on anxiety and aims to raise players\u2019 awareness of this emotion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warm and Healing Story</strong> \u2013 The protagonist will undergo self-exploration through dialogue and interaction, ultimately finding reconciliation with herself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/extras/96cc9a5e3b49d38cca3956ad6b0068a9.poster.avif?t=1754647094\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/extras/96cc9a5e3b49d38cca3956ad6b0068a9.webm?t=1754647094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/extras/96cc9a5e3b49d38cca3956ad6b0068a9.mp4?t=1754647094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her story is not a lonely one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She could be you, or me, or anyone struggling with anxiety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in reality, anxiety is not our enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is more like a well-meaning but awkward friend, and we just haven\u2019t learned how to get along with it yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/extras/bd8720c40b77e79dfac8ffbb01f5e05b.poster.avif?t=1754647094\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/extras/bd8720c40b77e79dfac8ffbb01f5e05b.webm?t=1754647094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/extras/bd8720c40b77e79dfac8ffbb01f5e05b.mp4?t=1754647094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, let anxiety transform into a little puppy, guiding you on a healing journey of self-reconciliation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that the next time you feel anxious, you will no longer criticize your emotions or yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because anxiety is not a monster; it\u2019s just a little puppy easily unsettled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/extras/4a55f1923fc838df35cbaa422731d72a.avif?t=1754647094\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking forward to meeting the little puppy, add it to your Wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
